    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d137">

                <pb facs="0188" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg96"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Defense Files: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Commander in Chief, Allied
                        Forces, North Africa</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eisenhower</hi>)<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d137-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">ultra secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Aboard the</hi> U. S. S. “<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Iowa</hi>”</placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-17"
                            >17 Nov[ember 19]43</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>From Com[mander] in Ch[ief] Embarked.</p>
                <p>Transmit to Former Naval Person[:] “Official information from Washington to
                    effect that meeting place is known to enemy through press and radio. Propose
                    meeting place be changed to Khartoum[.] “Confirm seriousness of leak. Adjust
                    transit as you deem requisite.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d137-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d137-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to Malta via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
